    <detaileddescription>
<para>RAII lock handle returned by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_consistent_hash_ring_1aa93a4cf990a56e4795a55d84c50f3fca" kindref="member">IConsistentHashRing::acquireRebalanceLock()</ref>.</para>
<para>While any <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_rebalance_lock_handle" kindref="compound">RebalanceLockHandle</ref> is alive the ring is immutable: callers observe the pre-rebalance ring until all handles are destroyed. </para>
